-45,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.heading,,,app,Evidence · 2,
-46,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.title,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,Network coverage and report timing,
-47,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.tooltip,,,app,Pin to keep this report in view. Pinning changes nothing in the mission.,
-48,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Pin: Network coverage and report timing,
-49,g8-prep,g8-brief,label,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,REFERENCE,
