-51,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Pin: Mission termination after RCS activation,
-52,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Console,
-53,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.button,,,g8-brief-continue,Go to preparation,
-54,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,"The last report tells us what was true when the crew sent it. Between tracking passes, we have no new information about their condition. Keep the report's observation time beside it; mark anything since that time as unconfirmed. The crew must act on their own until the next station acquires their signal.",
-55,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.provenance,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,Automatic at briefing; instructional reference grounded in H1. Sources: H1.,
-56,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-rule,"Both rings of the reentry control system have been activated to regain control, and substantial propellant has been used. Under these conditions, mission rules require termination. Cancel the remaining objectives and prepare a contingency return.",
-57,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.provenance,,,g8-ev-rule,Automatic at briefing; reference. Historical termination principle H2; game selection boundary F7. Sources: H2. Fiction register: F7.,
-58,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Unpin: Mission termination after RCS activation,
-59,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.button,,,app,GOT IT,
-60,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,briefing,,,g8-prep-select,"In the contact drill, Houston CAPCOM and a tracking-ship CAPCOM practice sending an instruction, reading it back, and confirming receipt to FLIGHT. In the recovery drill, Elias and the Department of Defense recovery coordinator practice passing the aircraft's location report to the ship and confirming who sends the pickup instruction. In the systems drill, Mara calls a low-propellant warning to FLIGHT and CAPCOM together, then passes her recommended response before the next entry task begins.",
