-62,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.prompt,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-prep-select,Choose up to two supplemental ground rehearsals.,
-63,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.hint,,,app,Opportunities remaining: 2 of 2. Reading reports and asking questions use no rehearsal opportunities.,
