-87,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.body,,contact rehearsal,g8-ev-contact-worksheet,"Houston CAPCOM sends the instruction to the tracking-ship CAPCOM, who reads it back and confirms receipt. FLIGHT checks the confirmation before treating the instruction as received. Mark missing observation times as unknown.",
-88,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.provenance,,contact rehearsal,g8-ev-contact-worksheet,"Acquired by g8-prep-contact; original F1 reference. Named practice calls and desk roles are original game exercises, not a claim that these exact rehearsals occurred before Gemini VIII. Fiction register: F1.",
-89,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.title,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-worksheet,Recovery drill: pickup instruction,
-90,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,ui.aria,,recovery rehearsal,app,Pin: Recovery drill: pickup instruction,
-91,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,option.requirement-reason,,two rehearsals,g8-prep-systems,No preparation opportunities remaining.,
-92,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.body,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-worksheet,Elias passes the aircraft's location report to the DoD recovery coordinator. They identify the desk that will send the ship its pickup instruction and check the readback. Record aircraft support and the ship's arrival separately.,
-93,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.provenance,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-worksheet,"Acquired by g8-prep-recovery; original F2 reference. Named practice calls and desk roles are original game exercises, not a claim that these exact rehearsals occurred before Gemini VIII. Fiction register: F2.",
