-96,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.body,,systems rehearsal,g8-ev-systems-worksheet,"Mara reports the RCS propellant warning to FLIGHT and CAPCOM together. She states what the instruments show, what remains uncertain, and the response she recommends for entry. CAPCOM reads the recommendation back before passing it on.",
-97,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.provenance,,systems rehearsal,g8-ev-systems-worksheet,"Acquired by g8-prep-systems; original F3 reference. Named practice calls and desk roles are original game exercises, not a claim that these exact rehearsals occurred before Gemini VIII. Fiction register: F3.",
