-117,g8-gap,g8-loss-of-contact,briefing,,,g8-loss-of-contact,The scheduled tracking pass has ended. There's no new report from the spacecraft.,
-118,g8-gap,g8-loss-of-contact,label,,,g8-ev-docked,PREVIOUS CONTACT,
-119,g8-gap,g8-gap-note,label,,,g8-gap-note,We'll have to wait for contact.,
-120,g8-gap,g8-gap-note,line,CAPCOM,,g8-gap-note#1,"Flight, we've lost the signal. The crew were docked on the last report. We'll call them at the next station.",
-121,g8-gap,g8-gap-note,line,(narration),contact rehearsal,g8-gap-note#2,CAPCOM has left the next report's receipt blank. Nothing new has come through.,
-122,g8-gap,g8-gap-note,question,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-q-gap,What can we confirm?,
-123,g8-gap,g8-gap-note,ui.button,,,g8-gap-note-continue,Wait for the next contact,
-124,g8-gap,g8-gap-note,answer,CAPCOM,,g8-q-gap,They confirmed docking before we lost contact. We can't confirm their present attitude or what they're doing now.,
-125,g8-report,g8-crisis-report,label,,,g8-report,Stabilization report,
-126,g8-report,g8-crisis-report,label,,,g8-report,TRACKING SHIP CONTACT,
-127,g8-report,g8-crisis-report,label,,,g8-crisis-report,Emergency report,
-128,g8-report,g8-crisis-report,line,CAPCOM,,g8-crisis-report#1,"Flight, Coastal Sentry Quebec has an emergency call. They're undocked and rolling out of control. The crew are working to stop it.",
