-132,g8-report,g8-crisis-report,ui.text,,,app,Observation time: unknown,
-133,g8-report,g8-crisis-report,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-crisis,The crew report an uncontrolled tumble after undocking. The report reaches the ground through Coastal Sentry Quebec.,
-134,g8-report,g8-crisis-report,evidence.provenance,,,g8-ev-crisis,Crisis receipt only; H1. Sources: H1.,
-135,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,label,,,g8-stabilization-report,Crew regain control,
-136,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,ui.alt,,,app,Portrait: Mara Voss — SYSTEMS,
-137,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,ui.heading,,,app,Mara Voss — SYSTEMS,
-138,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,line,Mara Voss — SYSTEMS,,g8-stabilization-report#1,They've regained control using the reentry thrusters. They've used substantial propellant from both RCS rings. That means we terminate the mission.,
-139,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,evidence.title,,,g8-ev-stabilized,Crew regain control.,
-140,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,ui.aria,,,app,Pin: Crew regain control.,
-141,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-stabilized,The crew have used the reentry control system to stabilize the spacecraft. The remaining mission objectives must be relinquished.,
-142,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,evidence.provenance,,,g8-ev-stabilized,Later stabilization receipt; H2. Sources: H2.,
-143,g8-report,g8-stabilization-report,line,Mara Voss — SYSTEMS,systems rehearsal,g8-stabilization-report#2,"Mara gives FLIGHT and CAPCOM the warning together, as rehearsed. The cause of the failure still isn't confirmed.",
-144,g8-report,g8-rule-decision,ui.aria,,,app,HISTORICAL CHOICE — open the history panel,
-145,g8-report,g8-rule-decision,ui.button,,,app,HISTORICAL CHOICE,
