-148,g8-report,g8-rule-decision,option.intent,,,g8-order-return,Terminate the remaining mission and prepare the contingency return.,
-149,g8-report,g8-rule-decision,ui.label,,,app,Risk,
-150,g8-report,g8-rule-decision,option.cost,,,g8-order-return,The remaining docking work and EVA are canceled.,
-151,g8-report,g8-rule-decision,option.attraction,,,g8-order-return,Bring the crew home under the mission's contingency rules.,
-152,g8-report,g8-rule-decision,option.uncertainty,,,g8-order-return,The room still needs to confirm the return plan and recovery support.,
-153,g8-report,g8-rule-decision,ui.button,,,app,Choose,
-154,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-recovery,The operational decision,
-155,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-recovery,RETURN PLANNING,
-156,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.badge,,,app,CONTACT: HOUSTON,
-157,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-return-brief,Return planning,
-158,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.alt,,,app,Portrait: Elias Reed — RECOVERY,
-159,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.heading,,,app,Elias Reed — RECOVERY,
-160,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.alt,,,app,Portrait: FLIGHT DYNAMICS,
-161,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.label,,,app,FLIGHT DYNAMICS,
-162,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,line,FLIGHT DYNAMICS,,g8-return-brief#1,Two return opportunities. The first gets them down sooner. The second puts the recovery force closer. We can't have both.,
-163,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,line,Mara Voss — SYSTEMS,,g8-return-brief#2,"Their condition is stable, for now. It might not be after another orbit.",
-164,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,line,Elias Reed — RECOVERY,,g8-return-brief#3,Every extra minute on the open ocean brings more risk to the crew. Take the later opportunity and the recovery force will be closer.,
-165,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,question,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-q-recovery-risk,What are the risks of an earlier return?,
-166,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,question,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-q-reserve-risk,What are the risks of another orbit?,
-167,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.title,,contact rehearsal,g8-ev-contact-readback,Instruction receipt checked,
-168,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.aria,,contact rehearsal,app,Pin: Instruction receipt checked,
-169,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.text,,,app,Received: RETURN PLANNING,
-170,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.title,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-readback,Pickup instruction confirmed,
-171,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.aria,,recovery rehearsal,app,Pin: Pickup instruction confirmed,
-172,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.title,,,g8-ev-reserve,RCS propellant remaining,
-173,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Pin: RCS propellant remaining,
