+33,prologue,g8-prologue-program,prologue.title,,,g8-prologue-program,LEARNING TO FLY TOGETHER,
+34,prologue,g8-prologue-program,prologue.caption,,,g8-prologue-program,"Gemini's two-person missions are teaching NASA how to work in orbit: stay longer, meet another spacecraft, and dock. Those are skills Apollo will need for the journey to the Moon.",
