+46,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.text,,,app,GEMINI VIII,
+47,g8-prep,g8-brief,label,,,g8-prep,Preparation,
+48,g8-prep,g8-brief,label,,,g8-prep,PRE-FLIGHT,
+49,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.badge,,,app,CONTACT: NOT IN FLIGHT,
+50,g8-prep,g8-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Preparation opportunities: 2 of 2 remaining,
