+106,g8-prep,g8-prep-select,evidence.provenance,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-worksheet,"Acquired by g8-prep-recovery; original F2 reference. Named practice calls and desk roles are original game exercises, not a claim that these exact rehearsals occurred before Gemini VIII. Fiction register: F2.",
