-325,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,label,,,g8-lesson-decision,Standing procedure,
-326,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,ui.prompt,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-lesson-decision,Adopt one standing procedure.,
-327,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.intent,,,g8-adopt-provenance,Require every report to separate confirmed observations from information still missing.,
-328,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.cost,,,g8-adopt-provenance,You can make only one procedure the standing requirement.,
-329,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.attraction,,,g8-adopt-provenance,Give the room a clear record of what was known and when.,
-330,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.uncertainty,,,g8-adopt-provenance,The next tracking pass may still leave important questions unanswered.,
-331,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.intent,,,g8-adopt-recovery,"Put aircraft support, ship arrival, and confirmation of each on one recovery sheet.",
-332,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.attraction,,,g8-adopt-recovery,Let the recovery desk check available help against the time the crew will spend at sea.,
-333,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.uncertainty,,,g8-adopt-recovery,A correctly recorded request may still reach a ship too far away to help quickly.,
-334,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,label,,,g8-postflight,Post-flight — Who carries the blame?,
-335,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,label,,,g8-postflight,WEEKS LATER — POST-FLIGHT DISCUSSION,
-336,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,label,,,g8-accountability-brief,Who carries the blame?,
-337,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,label,,,g8-accountability-brief,Post-flight discussion,
-338,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,briefing,,,g8-accountability-brief,They came home. Now the argument moves from the flight room to the astronaut office. Some call the crew's judgment into question. Others ask what the ground failed to prepare for. Your position will tell the crews whether this room stands behind them when the checklist runs out.,
-339,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,evidence.title,,,g8-ev-postflight-context,Disagreement after Gemini VIII,
-340,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Pin: Disagreement after Gemini VIII,
-341,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,ui.button,,,g8-accountability-brief-continue,Take a position,
-342,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-postflight-context,Post-flight analysis has cleared Armstrong and Scott of blame. Walt Cunningham has criticized aspects of their performance; Tom Stafford has argued that undocking from Agena was the wrong decision. Gene Kranz has identified a failure on the ground: too few contingency procedures for the docked phase. Frank Borman and Wally Schirra have defended the crew.,
-343,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,evidence.provenance,,,g8-ev-postflight-context,"Automatic only in the later post-flight scene. Attributed paraphrase of H5, a secondary account; not a transcript or an investigation document reproduced here. Sources: H5.",
-344,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-decision,option.intent,,,g8-back-crew-criticism,Side with Cunningham and Stafford and blame the crew's handling of the emergency.,
-345,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-decision,ui.label,,,app,Glen says,
-346,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-decision,option.statement,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-back-crew-criticism,I agree with the criticism. Armstrong and Scott's handling of the emergency deserves the blame.,
-347,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-decision,option.cost,,,g8-back-crew-criticism,"Armstrong and Scott lose trust in Glen, and division within the astronaut corps deepens.",
-348,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-decision,option.attraction,,,g8-back-crew-criticism,Gain Cunningham and Stafford's support by backing their criticism.,
-349,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-decision,option.uncertainty,,,g8-back-crew-criticism,The analysis has cleared the crew; your endorsement may prolong the argument rather than settle it.,
-350,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-decision,option.subtitle,,,g8-own-ground-contingencies,Ground contingency procedures,
-351,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-decision,option.intent,,,g8-own-ground-contingencies,Accept responsibility for the ground's lack of docked-flight contingency procedures.,
