+449,debrief,debrief,debrief,,,g8-db-return,Docking was achieved. The remaining objectives were terminated. Both crew members were recovered alive.,
+450,debrief,debrief,debrief,,earlier,g8-db-earlier,You chose to end spacecraft exposure sooner and accepted a prolonged sea recovery.,
+451,debrief,debrief,debrief,,earlier & recovery rehearsal,g8-db-pickup-clean,The recovery drill established who would send the pickup instruction. The desks didn't need to settle that during pickup; the ship still had to cover the same distance.,
+452,debrief,debrief,debrief,,contact rehearsal,g8-db-ack-clean,The contact drill helped CAPCOM confirm receipt on the first call. The room didn't need to ask again during the return.,
